    DEDUPLICATOR --> HERMES_CORE

    HERMES_CORE --> AGENT_TOKEN
    HERMES_CORE --> AGENT_MARKET
    HERMES_CORE --> AGENT_DISCOVERY
    HERMES_CORE --> AGENT_STRATEGY

    AGENT_MARKET -.->|Read Skill| SKILL_REGIME
    AGENT_STRATEGY -.->|Read Skill| SKILL_SIGNAL
    AGENT_TOKEN -.->|Read Skill| SKILL_SAFETY

    AGENT_TOKEN --> GATEWAY_MGR
    AGENT_MARKET --> GATEWAY_MGR
    AGENT_STRATEGY --> GATEWAY_MGR

    GATEWAY_MGR --> ADAPTER_OPENROUTER
    GATEWAY_MGR -.->|Fallback| ADAPTER_9ROUTE
    ADAPTER_OPENROUTER --> SCHEMA_VALIDATOR
    ADAPTER_9ROUTE --> SCHEMA_VALIDATOR
    SCHEMA_VALIDATOR --> AGENT_STRATEGY

    AGENT_STRATEGY --> STRATEGY_ENG
    STRATEGY_ENG --> RISK_GATE
    RISK_GATE -.->|Read Skill| SKILL_RISK
    RISK_GATE -->|PASS| PAPER_BROKER_ENG
    RISK_GATE -->|REJECT| ALERT_DISPATCHER
    RISK_GATE --> REPO_SIGNALS

    PAPER_BROKER_ENG --> COMPOUNDING_LEDGER
    COMPOUNDING_LEDGER -.->|Read Skill| SKILL_SIZING
    COMPOUNDING_LEDGER --> REPO_ORDERS
    COMPOUNDING_LEDGER --> REPO_PORTFOLIO
    COMPOUNDING_LEDGER --> ALERT_DISPATCHER

    CIRCUIT_BREAKER -->|Freeze Operations| RISK_GATE
    CIRCUIT_BREAKER -->|Broadcast Alert| ALERT_DISPATCHER

    REPO_WALLETS --> AUDIT_LOGGER
    REPO_SIGNALS --> AUDIT_LOGGER
    REPO_ORDERS --> AUDIT_LOGGER
    REPO_PORTFOLIO --> AUDIT_LOGGER
